{  
  "configuration_id": "config_037",  
  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that scvi_n200 RNA encoder with resnet50 image encoder achieves high performance (config_031, 0.6776 accuracy). This experiment tests replacing resnet50 with imagenet_vit_l image encoder while keeping multiprofile, avgpool aggregation, and weighted fusion (same as config_031). This isolates the impact of the image encoder choice on performance, building on the strong baseline of scvi_n200 RNA encoder. It balances exploration (testing a new encoder) with exploitation (building on a high-performing configuration) and addresses uncertainty about image encoder effectiveness in multiprofile setups."  
}

